<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Integrated Health.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Integrated Health.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it downgraded its intermediate-term rating on Integrated Health Services Inc to neutral from accumulate, keeping it as a long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- earlier Integrated Health and RoTech Medical Corp said they were merging.</p>
<p>-- Integrated Health was off 1-9/16 to 37-3/8.</p>
</text>
